# "Noncreature spells you cast cost {1} less to cast" (CR 601.2f, 118.7c). Bot1 casts three Moxen (free), then Geist ({1}{U}) off
# Island and Mox Pearl: no Geist yet, so it pays full price. With Geist out, Lightning Greaves ({2}) costs {1}: Mox Jet alone pays
# it (the empty pool is checked, and had the discount not applied the cast would still be owing). Lightning Bolt ({R}) has no
# generic part, so it is not made free: it still taps Mox Ruby. Greaves's Equip {0} (an ability, not a spell) is asked nothing.
# The Geist itself is a creature spell and not reduced either.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Geist of Saint Thalia
Lightning Greaves
Lightning Bolt
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

